WEBVTT

00:00:28.596 --> 00:00:30.316
no warehouses,

00:00:30.316 --> 00:00:31.556
no factories.

00:00:32.116 --> 00:00:35.356
It’s entirely powered by brains,

00:00:35.356 --> 00:00:36.556
by spreadsheets

00:00:36.556 --> 00:00:37.876
and by PowerPoint.

00:00:39.076 --> 00:00:40.836
Who is this mystery industry?

00:00:42.156 --> 00:00:47.356
The professional services
of advertising and PR firms,

00:00:47.356 --> 00:00:49.716
the big management consultancies,

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.596
the corporate lawyers and lobbyists.

00:00:53.156 --> 00:00:58.476
Together, this sector is worth
over two trillion dollars a year.

00:00:59.716 --> 00:01:03.436
Let’s call it the “X industry,”